<div align="center">

# Nexvora Digital: Agency Website

**A premium, production-ready website for a digital solutions and IT agency: e-commerce, AI, web, mobile, UI/UX, marketing and automation.**

Website Link: https://nds-sols.vercel.app/ 

![Next.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Next.js-16-000000?logo=nextdotjs&logoColor=white)
![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-19-61DAFB?logo=react&logoColor=black)
